  "body": "## What's Changed\n* harden(save): sanitize --save-suffix into a path-safe token by @nate-avra in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/736\n* Add consent-gated Windows MCP host controls by @Leit-motif in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/980\n* fix(tests): exempt LAST30DAYS_MCP_ALLOW_BROWSER_COOKIES from the config contract by @ahhhdum in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1157\n* chore(deps): bump zizmorcore/zizmor-action from 0.6.3 to 0.6.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1147\n* chore(deps): bump github/codeql-action/upload-sarif from 4.37.9 to 4.38.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1148\n* chore(deps): bump astral-sh/setup-uv from 10.0.1 to 10.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1149\n* feat(perplexity): add --perplexity-search-type opt-in and bound HTTP error-body reads by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1187\n* fix(perplexity): keep hosted routing without a direct key; never block Sonar on search type by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1188\n* fix(reddit): keep keyless Reddit discovery working after the RSS shutdown by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1189\n* chore(release): bump version to 3.26.0 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1190\n\n## New Contributors\n* @nate-avra made their first contribution in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/736\n* @Leit-motif made their first contribution in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/980\n* @ahhhdum made their first contribution in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1157\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/compare/v3.25.0...v3.26.0",
